        "text": "According to Jean-Claude Andre (Petitioner), according to Jean-Claude Andre (Petitioner), petitioners Lorenzo L. Jones and Timothy Williams filed administrative grievances with the Michigan Department of Corrections, which were investigated and decided, but later dismissed in federal court for failing to satisfy the Sixth Circuit\u2019s exhaustion requirement."
